# desc: protect yourself — audit, VPN, encryption, passwords
# termux package | fedora package | what it's for          ("-" = not available there)
-               | lynis           | audit THIS system, get a score + fixes (sudo lynis audit system)
wireguard-tools | wireguard-tools | your own VPN (wg, wg-quick)
age             | age             | simple file encryption: age -p secret.txt > secret.txt.age
gnupg           | gnupg2          | gpg — classic encryption and signing
pass            | pass            | password manager in the terminal (uses gpg)
